# Engineering docs do not belong in this repo. It is public, and working notes
# (upgrade plans, audits, PR playbooks) are not visitor material. They live in
# ~/projects/engineering-docs/ instead.
#
# Ignoring the whole folder is deliberate: adding a doc here has to be an
# explicit un-ignore, which is the approval step.
docs/
